guide forever/alliance/dwarf-gnome/01-dun-morogh
title Dun Morogh
faction Alliance
race Dwarf,Gnome
levels 1-13
zone Dun Morogh
next forever/alliance/02-westfall

# Route: the simulator's consensus route for the Dwarf start; Gnomes share it.
# One visit, levels 1 to about 12.3, no grind stops.
#
# Flow: Coldridge Valley -> Kharanos (bind) and Steelgrill's Depot -> the
# Grizzled Den and Gretchen's camp -> Rumbleshot and a short return to
# Coldridge for Grund -> Brewnall Village and Frostmane Hold -> back east to
# Kharanos and the depot -> Misty Pine Refuge -> Amberstill Ranch and the
# Gol'Bolar Quarry -> North Gate Outpost -> hearth to Kharanos -> Brewnall ->
# South Gate Outpost -> Farsen above the quarry -> Old Icebeard's cave ->
# Ironforge and the tram to Stormwind.
#
# Order changes against the export:
# - Felix's parts and the Mornbrew errand (3361, 3364, 3365) are finished
#   before leaving Coldridge Valley instead of walking back for Nori.
# - The Kharanos and depot pickups are grouped: the simulator shuttled between
#   them several times. Beldin's "A Visitor to Dun Morogh" (96408) is taken at
#   the depot on the way east after Brewnall instead of from the quarry.
# - The Shimmerweed for "The Perfect Stout" is gathered around Brewnall after
#   the hearth, where the simulator also did it.
#
# Left out: "The Reports" (291) and "Stout to Kadrell" (414) are accepted by
# the route but never turned in (the route goes to Westfall, not Ironforge's
# senator or Loch Modan).
# "The Adventurer" (96628) is kept as the export has it, taken from Thalos after
# "The Great Outdoors": skip it if Thalos no longer offers it.
# No class quests on this route.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Coldridge Valley

step Sten Stoutarm
  tip You start in front of Anvilmar, the stone hall at the north end of the valley. Sten Stoutarm waits outside the door.
  accept 179                                  -- Sten Stoutarm

step Young wolves
  tip Ragged Young Wolves roam the snow just south of Anvilmar.
  goto 28.3,73.6 "Ragged Young Wolves"
  collect 750 quest 179                       -- Tough Wolf Meat

step Anvilmar
  turnin 179                                  -- Sten Stoutarm
  accept 233
  accept 170                                  -- Balir Frosthammer, next to Sten
  train class                                 -- Level 2 spells, inside Anvilmar

step The troggs
  tip Rockjaw Troggs and Burly Rockjaw Troggs dig all over the valley floor south of Anvilmar. Hands Springsprocket stands at the mouth of the tunnel to the east.
  kill 707 quest 170                          -- Rockjaw Trogg
  kill 724 quest 170                          -- Burly Rockjaw Trogg
  accept 2160                                 -- Hands Springsprocket, at the tunnel

step Back to Anvilmar
  turnin 170                                  -- Balir Frosthammer
  accept 3361 lvl 3                           -- Felix Whindlebolt, by the door of Anvilmar

step Talin Keeneye
  tip Talin's camp is at the west end of the valley. Felix's Box lies in the snow south of it, his Chest by the troll cave and his Bucket of Bolts east of the cave: grab them as you pass.
  turnin 233                                  -- Talin Keeneye
  accept 183
  accept 234

step The boars
  tip Small Crag Boars graze around Talin's camp and along the west side of the valley.
  kill 708 quest 183                          -- Small Crag Boar
  collect 10438 quest 3361 @20.9,76.1         -- Felix's Box

step Talin Keeneye
  turnin 183

step Grelin Whitebeard
  tip Grelin and Nori Pridedrift camp at the south-west edge of the valley, below the troll cave.
  turnin 234                                  -- Grelin Whitebeard
  accept 182
  accept 3364 lvl 4                           -- Nori Pridedrift, next to him

step The troll cave
  tip Frostmane Troll Whelps fill the slopes south and east of Grelin's camp.
  kill 706 quest 182                          -- Frostmane Troll Whelp
  collect 16313 quest 3361 @22.8,80.0         -- Felix's Chest
  collect 16314 quest 3361 @26.3,79.3         -- Felix's Bucket of Bolts

step Grelin Whitebeard
  turnin 182
  accept 218

step Grik'nir the Cold
  tip Grik'nir the Cold sits at the back of the troll cave, east of Grelin's camp.
  goto 30.5,80.2 "Grik'nir the Cold"
  collect 2004 quest 218                      -- Grelin Whitebeard's Journal

step Grelin Whitebeard
  turnin 218
  accept 282

step Anvilmar
  turnin 3361                                 -- Felix Whindlebolt
  turnin 3364                                 -- Durnan Furcutter, inside Anvilmar
  accept 3365

step Nori Pridedrift
  turnin 3365                                 -- Back at Grelin's camp

step The tunnel
  tip Mountaineer Thalos guards the tunnel out of the valley, east of Anvilmar.
  turnin 282                                  -- Mountaineer Thalos
  accept 420

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Kharanos

step Kharanos
  tip Follow the road through the tunnel and north-east to Kharanos. Senir Whitebeard, Eric Brighthammer and his campfire are outside the Thunderbrew Distillery; Tannok, Maxan and Ragnar are inside; Tharek Blackstone works the forge.
  turnin 420                                  -- Senir Whitebeard
  turnin 2160                                 -- Tannok Frosthammer, in the distillery
  sethome "Thunderbrew Distillery"
  train class
  accept 400                                  -- Tharek Blackstone
  accept 99158                                -- Maxan Anvol
  accept 384                                  -- Ragnar Thunderbrew
  accept 98322                                -- Senir Whitebeard

step The Great Outdoors
  tip Sit by Eric's campfire (type /sit) and wait for the buff, then Gremlock Pilsnor in the distillery teaches you cooking.
  accept 96608                                -- Eric Brighthammer
  complete 96608
  turnin 96608
  accept 96629
  turnin 96629                                -- Gremlock Pilsnor

step Steelgrill's Depot
  tip Follow the road north-east from Kharanos to the depot below the Ironforge road.
  turnin 400                                  -- Beldin Steelgrill
  accept 317                                  -- Pilot Bellowfiz
  accept 313                                  -- Pilot Stonegear
  accept 5541                                 -- Loslor Rudge

step Boars and bears
  tip Crag Boars and Young Black Bears roam the fields around Kharanos and the depot. Buy the Rhapsody Malt from the innkeeper in the distillery.
  complete 384
  complete 317

step Kharanos
  turnin 384                                  -- Ragnar Thunderbrew
  accept 98321                                -- Tognus Flintfire

step Steelgrill's Depot
  turnin 317                                  -- Pilot Bellowfiz
  accept 318

