  turnin 97277

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Brewnall Village

step Frostmane Hold
  tip Frostmane Hold is the troll cave in the hills west of Brewnall Village. Kill Headhunters at its mouth and walk through to its far end.
  kill 1123 quest 287                         -- Frostmane Headhunter
  goto 22.8,52.1 "Frostmane Hold"
  complete 287

step Brewnall Village
  tip Brewnall Village sits on the lake north-west of Frostmane Hold.
  turnin 318                                  -- Rejold Barleybrew
  accept 315
  accept 319
  accept 310                                  -- Marleth Barleybrew
  accept 98326                                -- Gretta Ganter

step Gnomes, bears and leopards
  tip Leper Gnomes around Brewnall and the Gnomeregan road carry the cogs and gears. Ice Claw Bears, Elder Crag Boars and Snow Leopards roam the hills around the lake.
  complete 412
  kill 1196 quest 319                         -- Ice Claw Bear
  kill 1127 quest 319                         -- Elder Crag Boar
  kill 1201 quest 319                         -- Snow Leopard

