# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Old Icebeard

step Tundra MacGrann
  tip Tundra MacGrann camps in Chill Breeze Valley, south of Brewnall. His meats are in the locker in Old Icebeard's cave to the north-east of his camp: grab them and leave quickly.
  accept 312                                  -- Tundra MacGrann
