  turnin 312

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Ironforge

step The Deeprun Tram
  zone Ironforge
  tip Follow the road up to Ironforge. The Deeprun Tram leaves from Tinker Town, in the east of the city. Ride it to Stormwind.
  goto 78.0,51.4 "Deeprun Tram"
